Budget","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"6b8521d94cacf0b0","local":"46d246f64325a42e","content":"4fe76289d9f288d7"},"doc":"**Data processing for runs of a fixed-budget algorithm**: for two runs (in two environments)\nof a fixed-budget algorithm with budget `T`, the divergence between the laws of the outputs is\nat most the divergence between the laws of the histories of the first `T` rounds. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓨","role":"type","type":"Type u_2"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓓","role":"type","type":"Type u_3"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓐","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓐"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓨","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓨"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓓","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_4"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω'","role":"type","type":"Type u_5"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩ'","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω'"},{"explicit":false,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"IdentAlg Unit 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"T","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"O","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓐"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Y","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓨"},{"explicit":false,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"P'","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω'"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P'"},{"explicit":false,"name":"O'","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω' → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X'","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω' → 𝓐"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Y'","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω' → 𝓨"},{"explicit":false,"name":"out","role":"variable","type":"Ω → 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"out'","role":"variable","type":"Ω' → 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"env","role":"variable","type":"Environment Unit 𝓐 𝓨"},{"explicit":false,"name":"env'","role":"variable","type":"Environment Unit 𝓐 𝓨"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hA","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsFixedBudget T"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun env O X Y out P"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h'","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun env' O' X' Y' out' P'"}],"conclusion":"InformationTheory.klDiv (MeasureTheory.Measure.map out P) (MeasureTheory.Measure.map out' P') ≤\n  InformationTheory.klDiv (MeasureTheory.Measure.map (history O X Y T) P)\n    (MeasureTheory.Measure.map (history O' X' Y' T) P')","decl":"Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le"},"code":"/-- **Data processing for runs of a fixed-budget algorithm**: for two runs (in two environments)\nof a fixed-budget algorithm with budget `T`, the divergence between the laws of the outputs is\nat most the divergence between the laws of the histories of the first `T` rounds. -/\nlemma IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le (hA : A.IsFixedBudget T) (h : A.IsRun env O X Y out P)\n    (h' : A.IsRun env' O' X' Y' out' P') :\n    klDiv (P.map out) (P'.map out') ≤\n      klDiv (P.map (history O X Y T)) (P'.map (history O' X' Y' T))","proof":":= by\n  have hfin : Measurable (history O X Y T) := h.isAlgEnvSeq.measurable_history T\n  have hfin' : Measurable (history O' X' Y' T) := h'.isAlgEnvSeq.measurable_history T\n  let ι : Hist Unit 𝓐 𝓨 T → Σ n, Hist Unit 𝓐 𝓨 n := Sigma.mk (β := fun n ↦ Hist Unit 𝓐 𝓨 n) T\n  have hι : Measurable ι := measurable_sigma_mk _\n  calc klDiv (P.map out) (P'.map out')\n      ≤ klDiv (P.map (A.stoppedHist O X Y)) (P'.map (A.stoppedHist O' X' Y')) :=\n        h.klDiv_map_out_le_stoppedHist h'\n    _ = klDiv ((P.map (history O X Y T)).map ι) ((P'.map (history O' X' Y' T)).map ι) := by\n        rw [Measure.map_map hι hfin, Measure.map_map hι hfin']\n        congr 2 <;> exact funext fun ω ↦ hA.stoppedHist_eq ω\n    _ ≤ klDiv (P.map (history O X Y T)) (P'.map (history O' X' Y' T)) := klDiv_map_le _ _ hι","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/FixedBudget.lean","start":43,"end":60,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/FixedBudget.lean#L43-L60"},"deps":[93],"outside":[],"external":[["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Fin","lean4","structure"],["InformationTheory.klDiv","mathlib","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.stopSet","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.Round","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.history","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.pi","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsZeroOrProbabilityMeasure.toIsFiniteMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.map","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.instIsZeroOrProbabilityMeasureOfIsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["PUnit.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Prod","lean4","structure"],["Prod.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Set","mathlib","definition"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"],["Sigma","lean4","structure"],["Sigma.fst","lean4","definition"],["Unit","lean4","definition"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"ch